# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored via the *.local rule.
#
# NOTE: Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client bundle at build time.
# This keeps the value out of the repository — it does NOT make it secret, and
# anyone can read it in the shipped JavaScript. That is acceptable here because
# a Web3Forms access key can only send mail to the address it was issued for.
# A genuinely secret value would have to live behind a serverless function.
#
# Get a key at https://web3forms.com. Without it the contact form still works,
# falling back to the visitor's mail client.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
